<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-tarp.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-tarp-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-tarp.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="765" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Services</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker kicker-l">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services for Arkansas Property Claims</h1><p class="lede">Eleven services built around one job: an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss. Start with an estimate review, or bring Arkansas Insurance Appraiser in once appraisal has been demanded.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn btn-red" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-w" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid3" data-stagger><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/appointed-appraiser-representation/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span class="pcard-p">We serve as your named appraiser once appraisal is demanded, from the written notice to the signed award.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/home-insurance-claim-appraiser/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bungalow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bungalow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bungalow.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Independent valuation of disputed homeowner claims, from a single roof slope to a whole-house rebuild.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/commercial-hoa-property-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Appraisal for stores, offices, warehouses, churches, apartments and HOA communities.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-missing.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-missing-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-missing.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="854" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Hail and roof claims are the most common appraisal in Arkansas. We document, measure and price them properly.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/tornado-wind-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-field.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-field-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-field.webp 1023w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1023" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Tornado &amp; Wind Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">From EF-rated tornadoes to straight-line winds, we value structural and finish damage completely.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/hurricane-remnant-wind-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snapped-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snapped-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snapped-tree.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Hurricane Remnant &amp; Tropical Storm Claims</h2><span class="pcard-p">Gulf hurricanes can still bring damaging wind and rain to south Arkansas days after landfall.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/water-damage-claim-appraiser/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kitchen-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Water Damage Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Burst pipes, appliance leaks and storm water inside the home, valued to a full and dry repair.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/fire-smoke-loss-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1023w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1023" height="806" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Structure, smoke, soot and contents valued for a complete restoration, not a quick cleaning.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/ice-storm-freeze-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-tree-car.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-tree-car-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-tree-car.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="627" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Ice Storm &amp; Freeze Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Arkansas’s signature winter peril: ice-loaded trees, collapsed gutters, roof damage and burst pipes.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><span class="pcard-p">A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate so you know exactly what was missed and what it’s worth.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-appraisal-services/appraisal-umpire-services/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Appraisal Umpire Services</h2><span class="pcard-p">A neutral umpire for appraisal panels that need a third, independent decision-maker.</span><span class="more">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap duo top"><div class="duo-copy rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that difference is worth. Many disputes close at that stage.</p><p><a class="btn btn-red" href="/claim-appraisal-services/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></p></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle residential and commercial claims?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: houses, condos, rentals, apartments, retail, offices, warehouses, churches and HOA communities.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is hail all you do?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We handle tornado and wind, ice storm and freeze, water, fire, tree fall and hurricane-remnant claims as well.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Does the carrier’s number fall short?</h2><p>Send the estimate and your photos. We’ll review it and tell you plainly what we see.</p></div><div class="row"><a class="btn btn-white" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-w" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Send the estimate</a></div></div></section>
